    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=9$. Use $m=\\tan135^\\circ=-1$ and $\\dfrac{-5}{x-4}=-1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\tan135^\\circ=-1\\\\m&=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}=\\frac{-3-2}{x-4}=-1\\\\\\frac{-5}{x-4}&=-1\\\\x-4&=5\\\\x&=9\\end{align*}$$",
